<title>JAPAN: Asahi National - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Asahi National - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.93		vs	   16.23</p>
<p> Operating	  295    million    vs	  287    million</p>
<p> Current	    322    million    vs	  300    million</p>
<p> Net		  153    million    vs	  131    million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.80 yen	  vs	   10.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Asahi National Lighting Co Ltd is a manufacturer of residential lighting equipment.</p>
</text>
